  "description": "The Phaetus Rapido HF (Rapido 2) is a high-performance, high-flow hotend designed for fast printing with a 90W ceramic heater plate. The planar ceramic heater and bi-metallic heatbreak provide excellent thermal mass and separation. It uses V6-compatible nozzles (M6 thread), and the 40mm³/s flow rate makes it well-suited for high-speed direct-drive setups. The standard variant with 104NT thermistor is rated to 290°C; the Plus variant with PT1000 reaches 350°C.",
